cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: xslope
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python package for integrated seepage and slope stability
  analysis, combining limit equilibrium methods, finite element seepage, and
  finite element slope stability (shear strength reduction).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jones
    given-names: Norman L.
    affiliation: Brigham Young University
version: 0.1.51
date-released: 2026-06-15  # set to the actual v0.1.51 release date
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/njones61/xslope"
url: "https://xslope.org"
# Add the Zenodo concept DOI here after the first release is archived:
